<title>USA: Philadelphia Fed business index 25.2 in June.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia Fed business index 25.2 in June.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia on Thursday said its index of business activity in the manufacturing sector rose to 25.2 in June from 1.6 in May.</p>
<p>			     June   Drop   Unch   Rise     May</p>
<p>Business Conditions    25.2    6.7   58.7   31.9     1.6</p>
<p>New orders		 24.8   13.0   49.2   37.8     8.6</p>
<p>Shipments		  12.4   20.4   46.0   32.8    12.1</p>
<p>Unfilled orders	   6.3   12.1   64.7   18.4   - 7.1</p>
<p>Delivery time	     4.6    6.1   78.7   10.7   -11.5</p>
<p>Inventories	     - 4.6   21.4   60.8   16.8   -13.1</p>
<p>Prices paid		15.0    1.1   82.8   16.1    16.2</p>
<p>Prices received	   3.1    7.8   81.4   10.9   - 0.7</p>
<p>Number of employees    12.7    7.4   72.6   20.0     8.7</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-869-1660 ))</p>
